0 -14 Td
(Is sign language universal? No. Different sign languages exist and have their own) Tj
0 -14 Td
(linguistic rules.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Can it replace an interpreter? No. It is a limited prototype and should not replace) Tj
0 -14 Td
(qualified interpreters.) Tj
